curlcpp
------------------------------------------
An object-oriented C++ wrapper for cURL tool

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libcurlcpp-devel-3.1-1bl2
  libcurlcpp3-3.1-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/JosephP91/curlcpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/JosephP91/curlcpp/archive/refs/tags/3.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack curlcpp-3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./curlcpp-3.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/curlcpp-3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/curlcpp-3.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcurlcpp3-3.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcurlcpp-devel-3.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

